OL,3,GNEWSAEvent stopped after 'abuse' over
OL,4,Abeauty spot plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA consultation event for residents to
OL,7,Fstudy beauty spot restoration plans
OL,8,Fended early because of a protest and
OL,9,F"abusive and inflammatory language" on
OL,10,Fsocial media, organisers said.
OL,12,FCannop Ponds, in the Forest of Dean in
OL,13,FGloucestershire, were created in the
OL,14,F1820s, but Forestry England has said
OL,15,Fthey do not meet modern safety
OL,16,Frequirements.
OL,18,FRestoration plans, which are opposed by
OL,19,Fsome locals, will see a slipway
OL,20,Fcreated, a dam strengthened and a
OL,21,Fmixture of open water marsh and
OL,22,Freedbeds added.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
