OL,3,GNEWSAEvent stopped after 'abuse' over
OL,4,Abeauty spot plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FForestry England said "we believe in
OL,7,Ffreedom of speech and respect the right
OL,8,Fof people to protest peacefully " but
OL,9,Fadded the sessions ended for "the
OL,10,Fsafety and wellbeing" of its staff and
OL,11,Fthose in attendance.
